 in the missing words.", "type": "text"}]}, {"content": 1, "type": "template_override"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}]}], "id": 10, "stimuli_ids": []}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0, "correct": 0, "selected": 0}, {"_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1, "correct": 1, "selected": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Quiz", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "id": 11, "stimuli_ids": []}], "stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le12ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le12ob05re2img05.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn5le12ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "", "time": "0", "id": 0}, {"image": "engenn5le12ob05re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Vanessa, I'm really sorry about the other night. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You mean when we saw that awful movie, ran into your ex-girlfriend and then were questioned by the police?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: Uh, yeah. I never acted like that. I don't know what happened. I think I was upset about work or something.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn5le12ob05re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, promise me that you'll talk to me about it next time? It's not good to bottle things up inside.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: I promise I won't behave like that again. I'll always tell you what's on my mind.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: OK, Marco.", "time": "18300", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn5le12ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: I might be going hiking again this weekend. Will you come with me? I would love to treat you to a nice, romantic day. You deserve it!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hmm ... I may be working on the weekend. I have to check my timesheet.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: OK. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'll let you know later today.", "time": "32000", "id": 3}]}}], "id": 1}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "Vanessa Breaks up With Marco", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Trying to Work It Out", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Making and Responding to Promises", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you make a promise to someone, you tell them that you will definitely do something in the future. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">will</span> to make promises. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I'll never behave like that again.<br> I promise I'll talk to you about it next time. <br/> I promise I won't behave like that again!", "type": "text"}, {"content": "OK. <br>Sounds good.<br> I hope so!", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ben</span>: I'll always talk to you about my problems.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Becca</span>: I hope so! I promise I'll listen. <br/> <br/> <br/>", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About Possible Actions in the Future", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use the Future tense (<span class=\"strong\">will</span>) to talk about actions in the future. You can also use the modals <span class=\"strong\">might</span> and <span class=\"strong\">may</span> to talk about possible actions in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The auxiliary <span class=\"strong\">will </span> goes before the verb. The short form is <span class=\"strong\"> 'll</span>. The negative form of will not is <span class=\"strong\">  won't</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use the Future tense when you talk about the future, make offers or make predictions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "The modals <span class=\"strong\">might</span> and <span class=\"strong\">may</span> go before the verb. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "They talk about future possibility or chance that something will happen. <br><span class=\"strong\">Might </span>means there is a smaller chance that something will happen (30%).<br><span class=\"strong\">May </span> means there is a slightly greater chance that something will happen (50%).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Petra</span>: Will you come with me?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Kevin</span>: Hmm ... I may be working on the weekend. I'll let you know later today. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to act", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to do something in a particular way ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I never act like that. I don't know what happened.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to make promises.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to behave", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to act in a particular way ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I won't behave like that again.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to bottle things up inside ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to keep your feelings inside and not talk about them", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": " Example: It's not good to bottle things up inside.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to deserve something ", "type": "name"}, {"content": " to behave in a way that is worthy of reward ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You deserve a nice, romantic date.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "on my mind", "type": "name"}, {"content": "use this to talk about something you are thinking about ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": " (expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'll always tell you what's on my mind.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "awful", "type": "name"}, {"content": "terrible; very bad ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We saw that awful movie.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le12ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Read each role card. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose a role.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Create a dialogue about the situation with your partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Switch roles and practice again.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Think of two more roles and do another role play.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 1:</span><br/>  You are a student. You didn't do your assignment. You have to talk to your teacher and promise you will do it later.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Role 2:</span><br/>  You are a teacher. Your student didn't do their assignment. They make a promise. Respond to the promise.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I read both roles.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice with my partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use <span class=\"italic\">will</span>, <span class=\"italic\">may</span> or <span class=\"italic\">might</span>. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make promises.", "type": "text"}]}]}